     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Travelling independently",
     "texto": [
      "On a trip you can ask for information with **Nereden bilet alabilirim?** («Where can I buy a ticket?») and explain a problem with **Yardımınıza ihtiyacım var** («I need your help»).",
      "To tell a story, place the action in the past; to organise a plan, use the future and time expressions.",
      "Review introductions, comparisons, routines, shopping, work, advice and conditions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
